      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "KEY #4) REVIVAL MUST PRODUCE\nMORE THAN EMOTION — IT\nMUST PRODUCE A CHANGED LIFE",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 14,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "Matthew 7:16",
      "source_passage_index": 15,
      "verse_keys": [
        "MAT.7.16"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "2 Corinthians 5:17",
      "source_passage_index": 16,
      "verse_keys": [
        "2CO.5.17"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• A true revival changes\nthe way people live",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 17,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• It changes how husbands\ntreat their wives",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 18,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• It changes how wives\ntreat their husbands",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 19,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• It changes how parents\nraise their children",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 20,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• It changes how young\npeople make decisions",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 21,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• It changes how people\nconduct business",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 22,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• It changes how we treat the poor",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 23,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• It changes how we respond\nto those who disagree with us",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 24,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• It changes our\nattitudes toward sin",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 25,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• It changes our commitment\nto prayer and Scripture",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 26,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "Galatians 5:22",
      "source_passage_index": 27,
      "verse_keys": [
        "GAL.5.22"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "Galatians 5:23",
      "source_passage_index": 27,
      "verse_keys": [
        "GAL.5.23"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• A genuine response to a\nspiritual awakening should\nmake us more like Jesus",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 28,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• It should make us more loving,\nmore compassionate, more\ntruthful, more forgiving, and more\ncommitted to righteousness",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 29,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• The evidence of a genuine\nrevival is not merely how\nloudly people shout in church,\nbut how faithfully they live\nfor Jesus when they leave church!",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 30,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "KEY #5) THERE MUST BE CONVERGENCE",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 31,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• Convergence is the act or\nstate of coming together from\ndifferent directions to meet at a\ncommon point, limit, or similarity",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 32,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "Ephesians 4:4",
      "source_passage_index": 33,
      "verse_keys": [
        "EPH.4.4"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "Ephesians 4:5",
      "source_passage_index": 33,
      "verse_keys": [
        "EPH.4.5"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "Ephesians 4:6",
      "source_passage_index": 33,
      "verse_keys": [
        "EPH.4.6"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "John 17:21",
      "source_passage_index": 34,
      "verse_keys": [
        "JHN.17.21"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• The devil wants to divide the\nchurch over secondary matters\nwhile the world waits to hear\nthe primary message of salvation!",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 35,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "A SPIRITUAL AWAKENING CAN UNITE\nPEOPLE WHO HAVE BEEN DIVIDED",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 36,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "Ephesians 4:2",
      "source_passage_index": 37,
      "verse_keys": [
        "EPH.4.2"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "Ephesians 4:3",
      "source_passage_index": 37,
      "verse_keys": [
        "EPH.4.3"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "verse",
      "reference_text": "Luke 13:5",
      "source_passage_index": 38,
      "verse_keys": [
        "LUK.13.5"
      ],
      "version_text": "NKJV"
    },
    {
      "body_text": "KEY #6) BELIEVE IN THE\nPOWER OF THE GOSPEL",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 39,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• A revival that begins in the\nheart can eventually influence\na family, a community, a\nchurch, and even a nation",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 40,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "CONCLUSION: WHAT AMERICA\nAND THE WORLD NEEDS MOST\nIS ANOTHER SPIRITUAL AWAKENING",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 41,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• We should pray and follow\nthese keys for another\nspiritual awakening",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 42,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• We need revival in our pulpits",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 43,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• We need revival in our pews",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 44,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• We need revival in our homes",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 45,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• We need revival among\nour young people",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 46,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• We need revival in our communities",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 47,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• And we need revival\nin our own hearts",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 48,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
      "body_text": "• The greatest contribution Christians can\nmake to America is not simply to argue\nabout what is wrong with the nation,\nbut to live and proclaim the gospel\nthat can change the hearts of its people",
      "copyright_text": null,
      "kind": "point",
      "reference_text": "",
      "source_passage_index": 49,
      "verse_keys": [],
      "version_text": ""
    },
    {
